# tests/ carries ~34 MB of parquet fixtures that conftest.py needs, so the suite
# cannot be shipped usefully: including only the .py files leaves it unrunnable,
# and including the data would bloat every download. `prune` is required rather
# than simply omitting them - a distutils default otherwise pulls tests/test*.py
# into the sdist. Run the tests from a repository clone; see README, "Running the
# tests".
#
# notebooks/ needs no rule: nothing there is matched by a default, and a `prune`
# on an already-empty match warns on every build.
prune tests
